From c0050dda1a9f564bac35c37647b5fcb2f2d4a531 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CustomDeepseek <customdeepseek@localhost>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:37:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] customdeepseek: show provider balance, session cost and muse
 usage in the composer

A pill before the model picker reads the active route's balance (CloseRouter
/v1/credits, 7api /v1/balance, OpenRouter /api/v1/credits with the management
key, else /api/v1/key), the session's cost summed from the gateways' usage.cost
over every subagent session, and for the muse route the forwarder's weekly and
5h-window usage. pi-ai's patch now carries the gateway's usage.cost as
providerCost; TokenUsage gains cost; llm-pi-ai maps it. New Host plugin
@deepseek-ai/dsh-provider-billing (sessionCost projection, pollers, pricing
from the 7api and OpenRouter model lists, providerBilling.watch stream) and
client plugin @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-provider-billing, both mounted in the
web bundle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
