+---
+description: "Show the active provider's balance, this session's cost including subagents, and muse usage before the model picker."
+kind: "package-reference"
+---
+
+# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-provider-billing
+
+English | [中文](README.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+This CustomDeepseek plugin puts one pill before the composer's model picker. For a CloseRouter, 7api or OpenRouter route it reads `CloseRouter $107.31 · session $0.0123`; for the muse route it reads `Muse weekly 1% · 5h 3%`. The figures come from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-provider-billing`'s stream; the session cost covers every subagent session and is hidden whenever any call could not be priced.
+
+## Use this package
+
+The Web bundle includes this plugin. It has no configuration fields; the provider routes and poll periods belong to `@deepseek-ai/dsh-provider-billing`.
+
+## Model Experience
+
+None, as the plugin only renders figures the Host already holds.
+
+#### KV Cache effect
+
+None.
+
+## Known Limitations and Deferred Work
+
+- The pill has no click-open breakdown; the hover title names what each figure is.
