diff --git a/packages/llm/provider-billing/README.md b/packages/llm/provider-billing/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b4492c14d4a6ba5e96e87e95f5714602b8e13ea2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/llm/provider-billing/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+---
+description: "Poll provider balances and muse usage, fold per-session cost including subagents, and stream it to the composer."
+kind: "package-reference"
+---
+
+# @deepseek-ai/dsh-provider-billing
+
+English | [中文](README.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+This CustomDeepseek plugin shows what the active provider costs. It reads every `llm-pi-ai` route whose endpoint is CloseRouter, 7api or OpenRouter (balance) or whose credential is `MUSE_FORWARDER_KEY` (subscription usage), polls them every minute, folds every assistant call's gateway-reported `usage.cost` into a `sessionCost` projection, prices 7api and OpenRouter calls without a reported cost from their model lists, sums each session with its subagent sessions, and pushes one frame per change over the `providerBilling.watch` Remote stream.
+
+## Use this package
+
+Mount it in a profile beside `llm-pi-ai`; `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-provider-billing` renders the result. Configuration:
+
+```yaml
+- id: provider-billing
+  name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-provider-billing'
+  config:
+    balanceRefreshMs: 60000
+    priceRefreshMs: 600000
+    openRouterManagementKeyEnv: OPENROUTER_MANAGEMENT_KEY
+```
+
+Balances: CloseRouter `GET /v1/credits` (`total_credits`), 7api `GET /v1/balance` (`balance_usd`), OpenRouter `GET /api/v1/credits` with the management key (`total_credits - total_usage`), else `GET /api/v1/key` (`limit_remaining`, `null` means unknown). The management key comes from the credential seam, or on macOS from the login Keychain entry of the same name. A failed poll hides the figure; nothing is ever shown as `$0` by mistake.
+
+Session cost: a model whose every call reported a cost sums those costs; a model with any uncosted call is priced from its provider's price list as a whole; a model that cannot be priced makes the whole figure incomplete, which the pill hides. Secrets only ever travel in the outbound `authorization` header.
+
+## Model Experience
+
+None, as the plugin changes no model input: it reads session events and provider billing endpoints and publishes figures to the browser.
+
+#### KV Cache effect
+
+None.
+
+## Known Limitations and Deferred Work
+
+- CloseRouter calls that report no cost are not estimated from rates; only 7api and OpenRouter have price lists here.
